minio-from-source
=================

The container images built from this repository contain two programs that are
NOT covered by this repository's MIT license:

  MinIO server  https://github.com/minio/minio  GNU AGPL-3.0
  mc            https://github.com/minio/mc     GNU AGPL-3.0

Each image is built, unmodified, from the exact upstream commit recorded in the
image labels (io.github.minio-from-source.minio-commit and
io.github.minio-from-source.mc-commit) and in README.md. The complete
corresponding source for every image is that commit in the upstream repository
above. Their license texts are at LICENSE in each upstream repository.

